           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/os/" title="View all posts in OS" rel="category tag">OS</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/performance/" title="View all posts in Performance" rel="category tag">Performance</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/powershell/" title="View all posts in Powershell" rel="category tag">Powershell</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/virtual-pc/" title="View all posts in Virtual PC" rel="category tag">Virtual PC</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2009/07/1-reason-to-stick-with-windows-virtual-pc/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on 1 reason to stick with Windows Virtual PC"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="738 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2009/07/09/1-reason-to-stick-with-windows-virtual-pc.aspx">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
