          <div class="post-content clearfix">
          <p>For those who aren’t aware, Windows 7 (which I absolutely love) has the ability to mount and run native Virtual PC VHD’s.&#160; This is huge, but it isn’t exactly a cake walk.&#160; That is until now!&#160; DevHawk has provided a PowerShell script to make life beautiful.&#160; Never complain about your Virtual machine performance again… get [...]</p>

