        <div id="post-675" class="post-675 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-powershell">

          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2007/04/signing-your-powershell-profile-scripts/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Signing your Powershell Profile Scripts">Signing your Powershell Profile Scripts</a></h3>
           <p class="post-date">
            <span class="month">Apr</span>
            <span class="day">23</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/powershell/" title="View all posts in Powershell" rel="category tag">Powershell</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2007/04/signing-your-powershell-profile-scripts/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Signing your Powershell Profile Scripts"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="675 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2007/04/23/signing-your-powershell-profile-scripts.aspx">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
          </div>

          <div class="post-content clearfix">
